            Data Handling**     online, evaluating sources,      
                                organising data, and using that  
                                data to make decisions or        
                                produce evidence-based work.     

  **04**    **Online Safety &   Using strong passwords,          Safety
            Cybersecurity       recognising phishing, enabling   
            Awareness**         two-factor authentication,       
                                understanding privacy settings,  
                                and protecting personal and      
                                organisational data.             

